CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1789617413
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI reveals six more safety issues
OL,4,Aand unveils plan to disclose incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of OpenAI Sam Altman said
OL,7,Fearlier this week: "The world should
OL,8,Ftrust that we are going to do the right
OL,9,Fthing because it's the right thing and
OL,10,Fwe feel the magnitude of this."
OL,12,FAI has come under intense scrutiny in
OL,13,Frecent days following warnings over the
OL,14,Fserious potential risks it poses to
OL,15,Fhumans.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
